From: Calvin Myers <calmyers2112@outlook.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 04:46:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] guix/gram: config for the LG gram

Guix System and Guix Home files for the LG gram 16 2-in-1 (16T90R),
made from the Panasonic files in guix/:

- config.scm: NVMe disk, US keyboard, user calmy, sof-firmware, zram,
  power-profiles-daemon, Steam and rfkill udev rules. No circscroll.
- home.scm: the Panasonic programs plus LibreOffice, mpv, Krita,
  Kdenlive, Electrum, Tor Browser, Wine, Steam, Flatpak (Zen),
  wlsunset and GNOME Settings for the swaync panel, and the
  CaskaydiaCove Nerd Font. Links ~/.config/hypr, waybar, ... and
  bin/* to the repository. Makes a Guix copy of swaync/style.css.
  Skips a package name that Guix does not have, with a note.
- installer.scm: the Guix installer with the nonguix kernel and
  firmware, so that the gram's Wi-Fi works in the installer. Built on
  the Panasonic.
- INSTALL.md: backup, installer stick, Wi-Fi, install, restore and
  check steps.
- hypr/hyprland.lua: autostart without systemd (Guix).

